{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"DOI:\"10.1161/circulationaha.110.948562\"","resultType":"core","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":25,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"21060071","source":"MED","pmid":"21060071","doi":"10.1161/circulationaha.110.948562","title":"OMEGA, a randomized, placebo-controlled trial to test the effect of highly purified omega-3 fatty acids on top of modern guideline-adjusted therapy after myocardial infarction.","authorString":"Rauch B, Schiele R, Schneider S, Diller F, Victor N, Gohlke H, Gottwik M, Steinbeck G, Del Castillo U, Sack R, Worth H, Katus H, Spitzer W, Sabin G, Senges J, OMEGA Study Group.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Rauch B","lastName":"Rauch","firstName":"Bernhard","initials":"B","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Institut für Herzinfarktforschung Ludwigshafenan der Universität Heidelberg, Germany. rauch@zar-kardio-ludwigshafen.de"}]}},{"fullName":"Schiele R","lastName":"Schiele","firstName":"Rudolf","initials":"R"},{"fullName":"Schneider S","lastName":"Schneider","firstName":"Steffen","initials":"S"},{"fullName":"Diller F","lastName":"Diller","firstName":"Frank","initials":"F"},{"fullName":"Victor N","lastName":"Victor","firstName":"Norbert","initials":"N"},{"fullName":"Gohlke H","lastName":"Gohlke","firstName":"Helmut","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Gottwik M","lastName":"Gottwik","firstName":"Martin","initials":"M"},{"fullName":"Steinbeck G","lastName":"Steinbeck","firstName":"Gerhard","initials":"G"},{"fullName":"Del Castillo U","lastName":"Del Castillo","firstName":"Ulrike","initials":"U"},{"fullName":"Sack R","lastName":"Sack","firstName":"Rudolf","initials":"R"},{"fullName":"Worth H","lastName":"Worth","firstName":"Heinrich","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Katus H","lastName":"Katus","firstName":"Hugo","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Spitzer W","lastName":"Spitzer","firstName":"Wilhelm","initials":"W"},{"fullName":"Sabin G","lastName":"Sabin","firstName":"Georg","initials":"G"},{"fullName":"Senges J","lastName":"Senges","firstName":"Jochen","initials":"J"},{"collectiveName":"OMEGA Study Group"}]},"investigatorList":{"investigator":[{"fullName":"Senges J","lastName":"Senges","firstName":"Jochen","initials":"J"},{"fullName":"Schiele R","lastName":"Schiele","firstName":"Rudolf","initials":"R"},{"fullName":"Rauch B","lastName":"Rauch","firstName":"Bernhard","initials":"B"},{"fullName":"Gottwik M","lastName":"Gottwik","firstName":"Martin","initials":"M"},{"fullName":"Gohlke H","lastName":"Gohlke","firstName":"Helmut","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Steinbeck G","lastName":"Steinbeck","firstName":"Gerhard","initials":"G"},{"fullName":"Schneider S","lastName":"Schneider","firstName":"Steffen","initials":"S"},{"fullName":"DelCastillo U","lastName":"DelCastillo","firstName":"Ulrike","initials":"U"},{"fullName":"Marchioli R","lastName":"Marchioli","firstName":"Roberto","initials":"R"},{"fullName":"Gannedahl G","lastName":"Gannedahl","firstName":"Goran","initials":"G"},{"fullName":"Zimmer R","lastName":"Zimmer","firstName":"Reinhilde","initials":"R"},{"fullName":"Kübler W","lastName":"Kübler","firstName":"Wolfgang","initials":"W"},{"fullName":"Borggrefe M","lastName":"Borggrefe","firstName":"Martin","initials":"M"},{"fullName":"Mehmel H","lastName":"Mehmel","firstName":"Helmuth","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Holubarsch C","lastName":"Holubarsch","firstName":"Christian","initials":"C"},{"fullName":"Jung J","lastName":"Jung","firstName":"Jens","initials":"J"},{"fullName":"Victor N","lastName":"Victor","firstName":"Norbert","initials":"N"},{"fullName":"Gaus W","lastName":"Gaus","firstName":"Wilhelm","initials":"W"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"21","volume":"122","journalIssueId":1785379,"dateOfPublication":"2010 Nov","monthOfPublication":11,"yearOfPublication":2010,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"Circulation","title":"Circulation","essn":"1524-4539","issn":"0009-7322","nlmid":"0147763","isoabbreviation":"Circulation"},"printPublicationDate":"2010-11-01"},"pubYear":"2010","pageInfo":"2152-2159","abstractText":"<h4>Background</h4>There is no randomized, double-blind trial testing the prognostic effect of highly purified omega-3 fatty acids in addition to current guideline-adjusted treatment of acute myocardial infarction.<h4>Methods and results</h4>OMEGA is a randomized, placebo-controlled, double-blind, multicenter trial testing the effects of omega-3-acid ethyl esters-90 (1 g/d for 1 year) on the rate of sudden cardiac death in survivors of acute myocardial infarction, if given in addition to current guideline-adjusted treatment. Secondary end points were total mortality and nonfatal clinical events. Patients (n=3851; female, 25.6%; mean age, 64.0 years) were randomized in 104 German centers 3 to 14 days after acute myocardial infarction from October 2003 until June 2007. Acute coronary angiography was performed in 93.8% and acute percutaneous coronary intervention in 77.8% of all patients. During a follow-up of 365 days, the event rates were (omega and control groups) as follows: sudden cardiac death, 1.5% and 1.5% (P=0.84); total mortality, 4.6% and 3.7% (P=0.18); major adverse cerebrovascular and cardiovascular events, 10.4% and 8.8% (P=0.1); and revascularization in survivors, 27.6% and 29.1% (P=0.34).<h4>Conclusions</h4>Guideline-adjusted treatment of acute myocardial infarction results in a low rate of sudden cardiac death and other clinical events within 1 year of follow-up, which could not be shown to be further reduced by the application of omega-3 fatty acids.<h4>Clinical trial registration</h4>URL: http://www.clinicaltrials.gov. Unique identifier: NCT00251134.","affiliation":"Institut für Herzinfarktforschung Ludwigshafenan der Universität Heidelberg, Germany. rauch@zar-kardio-ludwigshafen.de","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print-Electronic","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Multicenter Study","Randomized Controlled Trial","Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Humans"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Death, Sudden, Cardiac","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"EP","qualifierName":"epidemiology"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"PC","qualifierName":"prevention & control"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Myocardial Infarction","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"DT","qualifierName":"drug therapy"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"MO","qualifierName":"mortality"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Fatty Acids, Omega-3","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"AD","qualifierName":"administration & dosage"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"AE","qualifierName":"adverse effects"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Treatment Outcome"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Combined Modality Therapy"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Patient Discharge"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Myocardial Revascularization"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Follow-Up Studies"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Feeding Behavior"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Patient Compliance"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Placebo Effect"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Seafood"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Aged"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Middle Aged"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Female"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Male"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Practice Guidelines as Topic"}]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"Fatty Acids, Omega-3","registryNumber":"0"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Free after 12 months","availabilityCode":"F12","documentStyle":"html","site":"intl-circ.ahajournals.org","url":"http://intl-circ.